# Image16k.gz: the helper VM's kernel for the phone's native EL0 engine. installer/helper/kernel.config
# (asoft-ios) plus these three lines, built by installer/helper/build-kernel.sh (Linux 6.12.114 for the
# measured one, 2026-11-08). The engine mirrors guest user pages at their own address in [4 GiB, 64 GiB),
# XNU's user space; 16 KiB pages with a 36-bit user address space put Linux's user space there too
# (PIE programs near 42 GiB, mmap and the stack below 64 GiB). The guest then runs with
# -cpu cortex-a76,x-host-counter=on,cntfrq=19200000 and ASOFT_NATIVE_EL0_PAC=off (Helper.java).
CONFIG_EXPERT=y
CONFIG_ARM64_16K_PAGES=y
CONFIG_ARM64_VA_BITS_36=y
